# Features Organization

Features are organized into dedicated modules that encapsulate related functionality.

## Feature Categories

- `3d` - 3D visualizations and interactions
- `admin` - Administrative features
- `ai` - AI-powered features and integrations
- `case-files` - Case file management features
- `collab` - Collaboration tools
- `data-viz` - Data visualization features
- `mindmap` - Mind mapping functionality
- `r3f` - React Three Fiber components and features
- `user` - User account and profile features

## Key Feature Files

- [apps/app/src/features/3d](mdc:ultraterrestrial-resurrection/apps/app/src/features/3d) - 3D visualization features
- [apps/app/src/features/ai](mdc:ultraterrestrial-resurrection/apps/app/src/features/ai) - AI features
- [apps/app/src/features/mindmap](mdc:ultraterrestrial-resurrection/apps/app/src/features/mindmap) - Mind mapping features
- [apps/app/src/features/case-files](mdc:ultraterrestrial-resurrection/apps/app/src/features/case-files) - Case file features

## Feature Structure

Features typically follow this structure:
- `components/` - UI components specific to the feature
- `hooks/` - React hooks for feature functionality
- `utils/` - Utility functions
- `store/` - State management 
- `actions/` - Feature actions and operations
